    {
      "screen_id": "MAT-A-P-01-S1",
      "unit": "01",
      "audience": "adults",
      "title": {
        "id": "Hitung cepat sehari-hari",
        "en": "Everyday mental math"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "id": "Hitung di kepala itu soal trik, bukan bakat. Trik pertama: bulatkan dulu, lalu sesuaikan. Untuk Rp19.900 × 3, hitung Rp20.000 × 3 = Rp60.000, lalu kurangi 3 × Rp100 = Rp300. Hasilnya Rp59.700.",
          "en": "Mental maths is about tricks, not talent. Trick one: round first, then adjust. For Rp19,900 × 3, work out Rp20,000 × 3 = Rp60,000, then take off 3 × Rp100 = Rp300. The answer is Rp59,700."
        },
        {
          "id": "Mengalikan dengan 5? Kalikan 10, lalu bagi 2: 48 × 5 = 480 : 2 = 240. Mengalikan dengan 25? Kalikan 100, lalu bagi 4: 36 × 25 = 3.600 : 4 = 900.",
          "en": "Multiplying by 5? Times 10, then halve: 48 × 5 = 480 ÷ 2 = 240. Multiplying by 25? Times 100, then divide by 4: 36 × 25 = 3,600 ÷ 4 = 900."
        },
        {
          "id": "Bilangan dua angka dikali 11? Jumlahkan kedua angkanya dan taruh di tengah: 11 × 43 = 4 (4 + 3) 3 = 473. Kalau jumlahnya 10 atau lebih, simpan 1 ke depan: 11 × 68 = 748.",
          "en": "A two-digit number times 11? Add its digits and put the sum in the middle: 11 × 43 = 4 (4 + 3) 3 = 473. If the sum is 10 or more, carry 1 to the front: 11 × 68 = 748."
        },
        {
          "id": "Patungan makan? Bagi total dengan jumlah orang untuk mendapatkan bagian yang sama persis. Jika diminta memperkirakan uang yang perlu dikumpulkan, Anda dapat membulatkan tiap bagian ke atas ke ribuan terdekat supaya tidak kurang.",
          "en": "Splitting a bill? Divide the total by the number of people to find each exact share. If asked to estimate how much to collect, you can round each share up to the nearest thousand so the collection is not short."
        }
      ],
      "review_status": "approved"
    }
  ],
